---
// P1: WebKit-only custom scrollbar in style block without W3C scrollbar-width or scrollbar-color
---
<div class="scroll-box">
  <p>Scrollable content</p>
</div>

<style>
  .scroll-box::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: 8px;
  }
  .scroll-box::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: #cbd5e1;
  }
</style>
